        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and mobility"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Well appearing, no acute distress, mobilising independently."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Normal spinal alignment with no deformity. Mild bilateral lumbar paraspinal tenderness; no midline bony tenderness. Flexion and extension mildly reduced by pain at end range; lateral flexion and rotation near full. Straight leg raise negative bilaterally. FABER caused mild low back discomfort without groin pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Lower limb neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Power 5/5 in all groups; reflexes normal and symmetrical; sensation intact L2–S1; gait normal."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-16",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Abdominal examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Soft, non-tender, non-distended; no masses or organomegaly. No suprapubic or costovertebral angle tenderness. No obvious abdominal mass, although palpation limited by body habitus."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-17",
      "resource": {
